internal object WorldHaDraft26 {
    val MAP: Map<String, String> = mapOf(
        "Stand silently and listen to the imam. Do not recite al-Fatihah or a surah, whether he recites aloud or quietly." to "Ka tsaya shiru ka saurari liman. Kada ka karanta fatiha ko sura, ko yana karantawa a bayyane ko a nutse.",
        "When the imam finishes al-Fatihah aloud, say Ameen quietly." to "Idan liman ya karasa fatiha da karfi sai yace Ameen.",
        "Recite Surah al-Fatihah, say Ameen quietly, then recite a surah or at least three short verses." to "Ka karanta suratul Fatiha, ka ce Ameen a nitse, sannan ka karanta sura ko akalla gajerun ayoyi uku.",
        "Any surah you know may be recited. Keep the order of the Quran: the surah of the second rak‘ah should come after that of the first." to "Duk wata sura da ka sani ana iya karanta ta. Kiyaye tsarin Alqur'ani: surar raka'ah ta biyu zata zo bayan ta farko.",
        "Recite Bismillah, Surah al-Fatihah and another surah, as in the first rak‘ah." to "Karanta Bismillah, Suratul Fatiha da wata sura, kamar yadda yake a raka’ar farko.",
        "In Sunnah, Nafl and Witr a surah is added after al-Fatihah in every rak‘ah." to "A Sunnah, Nafil da Witiri ana kara sura bayan fatiha a kowace raka'a.",
        "Recite Bismillah and Surah al-Fatihah only. No surah is added in the third and fourth rak‘at of a Fard prayer." to "Karanta Bismillah da Suratul Fatiha kawai. Ba a kara sura a raka’a ta uku da ta hudu na sallar Fardi.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut" to "Dua-e-Qunut",
        "After the surah of the third rak‘ah, raise the hands {hands} saying Allahu Akbar, fold them again and recite Dua-e-Qunut quietly. Then go into ruku‘." to "Bayan surar raka'a ta uku sai a daga hannu {hands} kana cewa Allahu Akbar, ka sake ninke su sannan ka karanta addu'ar a nutse. Sai ku shiga ruku'u.",
        "If you have not memorised it yet, recite ‘Rabbana atina…’ or say ‘Allahummaghfir li’ three times, and keep learning it." to "Idan har yanzu ba ku haddace ta ba, sai ku karanta ‘Rabbana atina...’ ko kuma ku ce ‘Allahummaghfir li’ sau uku, kuma ku ci gaba da koyan shi.",
        "Ruku‘" to "Ruku'",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow. Grip the knees with the fingers spread, keep the back level and the head in line with it. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allahu Akbar ka rusuna. Rike gwiwoyi tare da yada yatsu, kiyaye matakin baya da kai a layi tare da shi. Karanta tasbihi akalla sau uku.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow only as far as the hands reach the knees. Rest the hands on the knees with the fingers together, keep the arms close to the body and do not straighten the back fully. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Ku ce Allahu Akbar, ku yi ruku'u sai dai hannu ya kai ga gwiwoyi. Sanya hannaye akan gwiwoyi tare da yatsunsu tare, kiyaye hannayen kusa da jiki kuma kada ku daidaita baya sosai. Karanta tasbihi akalla sau uku.",
        "Qawmah (standing up)" to "Qawmah (a tsaye)",
        "Rise saying Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, stand fully upright with the arms at the sides, and say Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Tashi tana cewa Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, ka tsaya tsayin daka da hannaye a gefe, ka ce Rabbana wa lakal-hamd.",
        "When the imam says Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, rise, stand fully upright and say only Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Lokacin da liman ya ce Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, ka tashi, ka tsaya tsayin daka ka ce Rabbana wa lakal-hamd kawai.",
        "Pause until every joint has settled before going down." to "Dakata har sai kowane haɗin gwiwa ya daidaita kafin sauka.",
        "Two sajdahs" to "Sajdah biyu",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down: knees first, then hands, then nose and forehead between the hands. Keep the elbows raised, the arms away from the sides, the belly away from the thighs, and the toes pressed towards the Qibla. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Ka ce Allahu Akbar ka gangara: gwiwoyi tukuna, sannan hannuwa, sannan hanci da goshi tsakanin hannaye. Ka kiyaye gwiwar hannu, a nesantar da hannaye daga gefe, ciki daga cinyoyinsu, da matse yatsun kafa zuwa alkibla. Karanta tasbihi akalla sau uku.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down into sajdah drawn together: the arms resting on the ground close to the sides, the belly on the thighs and both feet turned out to the right. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Ka ce Allahu Akbar, kuma ku gangara cikin sajdah an zana tare: Hannun da ke kan qasa kusa da gefuna, ciki a kan cinyoyinsa da ƙafafu biyu ya juya zuwa dama. Karanta tasbihi akalla sau uku.",
        "Rise with Allahu Akbar and sit upright for a moment (Jalsa). You may say Rabbighfir li." to "Ku tashi tare da Allahu Akbar ku zauna tsaye na dan lokaci (Jalsa). Kuna iya cewa Rabbighfir li.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and make the second sajdah in the same way." to "Kace Allahu Akbar kayi Sajdah ta biyu haka.",
        "After the second sajdah say Allahu Akbar and remain seated." to "Bayan Sajdah ta biyu kace Allahu Akbar ka zauna.",
        "Then stand up for the next rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar, without sitting or leaning on the ground." to "Sai ka tashi raka'a na gaba kana cewa Allahu Akbar, ba tare da zama ko jingina a kasa ba.",
        "First sitting (Qa‘dah Ula)" to "Zaune na farko (Qa'dah Ula)",
        "Recite only the Tashahhud." to "Karanta Tashahhud kawai.",
        "Then stand for the third rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar." to "Sai a tsaya raka'a ta uku tana cewa Allahu Akbar.",
        "In four rak‘at of Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah or Nafl, also recite Durood and dua here and begin the third rak‘ah with Thana. In Sunnah Muakkadah recite only the Tashahhud." to "A cikin raka'a hudu na Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah ko Nafil, kuma a karanta Durood da dua a nan kuma a fara raka'a ta uku da Thana. A Sunnah Muakkadah a karanta Tashahhud kawai.",
        "Final sitting (Qa‘dah Akhirah)" to "Zama na karshe (Qa'dah Akhirah)",
        "Recite the Tashahhud, then Durood-e-Ibrahim, then a dua." to "Karanta Tashahhud, sannan Durood-e-Ibrahim, sannan a dua.",
        "Either of the two duas shown is enough." to "Duk addu'o'in da aka nuna sun isa.",
        "Salam" to "Salam",
        "Turn the face to the right and say As-salamu ‘alaykum wa rahmatullah, then to the left and say it again. The prayer is complete." to "Ka juyar da fuskar dama ka ce As-salamu ’alaykum wa rahmatullah, sannan hagu ka sake cewa. Sallah ta cika.",
        "Give each salam just after the imam, never before him." to "Yi wa kowace sallama bayan liman, ba a gabansa ba.",
        "After the salam" to "Bayan sallama",
        "Say Astaghfirullah three times, recite Ayat al-Kursi and the Tasbih of Fatimah, then raise your hands and make dua." to "Kace Astaghfirullah sau uku, ka karanta ayatul Kursiyyi da tasbihi na Fatimah, sannan ka daga hannu kayi addu'a.",
        "After a Fard that is followed by Sunnah (Zuhr, Maghrib, Isha), make a short dua, pray the Sunnah, and recite these afterwards." to "Bayan wata Fardi da Sunnah ta bi (Zuhr, Maghrib, Isha), sai a yi gajeriyar addu'a, sannan a karanta sunna, sannan a karanta.",
        "Conditions of Salah" to "Sharuddan Sallah",
        "Six things that must be in place before the prayer" to "Abubuwa guda shida da ya zama wajibi a yi su kafin sallah",
        "Taharah: the body, the clothes and the place of prayer are clean, and you are in wudu, or have made ghusl where it is due." to "Taharah: Jiki da Tufafi da wurin Sallah suna da tsafta, kuma kana cikin Alwala, ko ka yi Gus a inda ya dace.",
        "Satr-e-awrah: a man covers from the navel to below the knees; a woman covers her whole body except the face, the hands and the feet." to "Satr-e-awrah: mutum yana rufe tun daga cibiya zuwa kasa da gwiwoyi; mace ta rufe dukkan jikinta sai fuska, hannuwa da kafafu.",
        "Istiqbal-e-Qibla: facing the Ka‘bah." to "Istiqbal-e-Qibla: yana fuskantar Ka'aba.",
        "Waqt: the time of that prayer has entered." to "Waqt: lokacin wannan sallah ya shiga.",
        "Niyyah: a firm intention in the heart for that particular prayer." to "Niyyah: Tsayayyen niyya a cikin zuciya ga waccan addu'a.",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah: beginning the prayer with Allahu Akbar." to "Takbir-e-Tahrimah: fara sallah da Allahu Akbar.",
        "Fard acts of Salah" to "Fard ayyukan Salah",
        "Seven pillars inside the prayer" to "Ginshikai bakwai a cikin sallah",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah." to "Takbir-e-Tahrimah.",
        "Qiyam: standing, for one who is able, in Fard and Wajib prayers." to "Qiyamu: tsayuwa ga wanda yake da ikon, a cikin Sallar Fardi da Wajib.",
        "Qira’at: reciting the Quran while standing." to "Qira’at: karatun Alqur’ani a tsaye.",
        "Ruku‘." to "Ruku'.",
        "Sujud: two sajdahs in every rak‘ah." to "Sujud: Sajdah biyu a kowace raka’ah.",
        "Qa‘dah Akhirah: sitting at the end for the length of the Tashahhud." to "Qa‘dah Akhirah: Zaune a karshen tsawon Tashahhud.",
        "Khuruj bi-sun‘ihi: leaving the prayer by an act of your own, such as the salam." to "Khuruj bi-sun‘ihi: Barin sallah da wani aiki naka, kamar sallama.",
        "A missed Fard cannot be repaired by Sajdah Sahw; the prayer must be prayed again." to "Sajdah Sahw ba za ta iya gyara Fard da aka rasa ba; dole ne a sake yin addu'a.",
        "Wajib acts of Salah" to "Wajib ayyukan Sallah",
        "The necessary acts that complete the pillars" to "Ayyukan da ake bukata waɗanda suka cika ginshiƙai",
        "Beginning the prayer with the words Allahu Akbar." to "Fara Sallah da fadin Allahu Akbar.",
        "Reciting Surah al-Fatihah, and adding a surah or three short verses in the first two rak‘at of Fard and in every rak‘ah of Witr, Sunnah and Nafl." to "Karanta Suratul Fatiha, da kuma kara sura ko gajerun ayoyi uku a cikin raka'a biyun farko na Fard da kowace raka'ar Witr, Sunnah da Nafil.",
        "Reciting al-Fatihah before the surah." to "Karatun fatiha kafin sura.",
        "Qawmah, standing upright after ruku‘, and Jalsa, sitting upright between the two sajdahs." to "Qawmah, tsaye bayan ruku'u, da Jalsa, zaune a tsakar Sajdah biyu.",
        "Ta‘dil-e-arkan: staying still in ruku‘, qawmah, sajdah and jalsa for at least one ‘Subhanallah’." to "Ta’dil-e-arkan: zama a ruku’, qawmah, sajdah da jalsa a kalla ‘Subhanallah’ guda daya.",
        "Qa‘dah Ula, the first sitting in a three- or four-rak‘at prayer, and reciting the full Tashahhud in both sittings." to "Qa'dah Ula, zama na farko a cikin sallah raka'a uku ko hudu, da karanta cikakken Tashahhud a cikin zama biyu.",
        "Adding nothing after the Tashahhud in the first sitting of Fard, Witr and Sunnah Muakkadah." to "Kar a kara komai bayan Tashahud a Zauren Farko, Witr da Sunnah Muakkadah.",
        "Ending the prayer with the word ‘As-salam’ twice." to "Karshen Sallah da lafazin ‘As-salam’ sau biyu.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut in Witr, and the takbir before it." to "Dua-e-Qunut in Witr, da takbir da ke gabansa.",
        "The six extra takbirs of the two Eid prayers." to "Karin takbiri guda shida na sallar idi biyu.",
        "The imam reciting aloud in Fajr, Maghrib, Isha, Jumu‘ah and Eid, and quietly in Zuhr and Asr." to "Limamin yana karatu a cikin Fajr, Maghrib, Isha, Juma'ah da Idi, kuma cikin nutsuwa a Zuhur da La'asar.",
        "The follower staying silent while the imam recites, and following the imam in every act." to "Mabiyi ya yi shiru yayin da liman yake karatu, da bin liman a kowane aiki.",
        "Keeping every Fard and Wajib in its place, without delaying or repeating it." to "Ajiye kowane Fard da Wajib a wurinsa, ba tare da bata lokaci ko maimaita ba.",
